00:05:37.603 --> 00:05:38.804
I mean, as you know,

00:05:38.838 --> 00:05:40.973
we seem to have some inbuilt
attentional biases towards red

00:05:41.006 --> 00:05:43.709
like say the little buzzing
red lights on smartphones

00:05:43.742 --> 00:05:45.044
works really well that way

00:05:45.077 --> 00:05:47.580 align:start size:97% position:3%
because we tend to
automatically attend to them.

00:05:47.613 --> 00:05:50.116 align:start size:88% position:13%
It could be blood,
yeah, could be fire even

00:05:50.149 --> 00:05:53.519 align:start size:97% position:3%
