in advanced social species

00:10:53.018 --> 00:10:56.355
through observation and kind
of social emotional contagion.

00:10:56.388 --> 00:10:57.856
- Very cool.

00:10:57.889 --> 00:10:58.757 align:start size:91% position:9%
All right, guys, let's
