suggestion, hypnosis,
placebo effects,

00:16:12.404 --> 00:16:15.741 align:start size:97% position:3%
anytime the mind is regulating
the body or vice versa,

00:16:15.774 --> 00:16:17.242 align:start size:81% position:19%
that that's a
topic that we study

00:16:17.275 --> 00:16:19.411
- Now, you said
