layers of credibility.

00:16:47.505 --> 00:16:50.475
They really believe that
what we're doing is real.

00:16:50.508 --> 00:16:52.444 align:start size:81% position:19% line:0%
- What's interesting
is that children

00:16:52.477 --> 00:16:55.247 line:0%
they're not immune to the
power of neuro enchantment

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:57.382
- Neuro enchantment?
- Neuro enchantment.

00:16:57.415 --> 00:16:58.216
- What does that mean?

00:16:58.249 --> 00:16:59.418
- So it's this idea

00:16:59.451 --> 00:17:01.753 align:start size:84% position:16%
that there is some
kind of medical magic,

00:17:01.786 --> 00:17:04.556 align:start size:84% position:16%
there is immense
power that is attached

00:17:04.589 --> 00:17:06.324
to the culture of neuroscience,

00:17:06.357 --> 00:17:09.728
whereby neuro scientific
props and accessories,

00:17:09.761 --> 00:17:13.465
have more healing power,
more physiological effects,

00:17:13.498 --> 00:17:16.535 align:start size:91% position:9%
because culturally, people
