00:17:16.568 --> 00:17:19.237 align:start size:97% position:3%
I mean, the same kinds of
cultural cognitive mechanisms

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:21.573 align:start size:78% position:22%
are at play in
religious systems.

00:17:21.606 --> 00:17:23.108
So here we are praying

00:17:23.141 --> 00:17:26.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
to the gods of neuroscience,
and biomedicine.

00:17:26.211 --> 00:17:28.513
- Talk to me about
the ethics of lying.

00:17:28.546 --> 00:17:30.315
- The work we do with children

00:17:30.348 --> 00:17:31.850
actually does not involve lying,

00:17:31.883 --> 00:17:34.553
we tell them at first that
everything that they see

00:17:34.586 --> 00:17:35.787
