00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:30.342 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Not too many
people get the chance

00:18:30.375 --> 00:18:32.310
to have this awesome experience,

00:18:32.343 --> 00:18:34.679 align:start size:84% position:16%
but we hear the
scientists in Canada--

00:18:34.712 --> 00:18:38.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
- I gonna have it?
- Yeah, and it's very cool.

00:18:38.349 --> 00:18:41.453
So what do you hope the
machine allows you to do?

00:18:41.486 --> 00:18:42.487
It makes you better at.

00:18:42.521 --> 00:18:45.724 align:start size:91% position:9%
- Better at concentrating,
better at focusing.

00:18:45.757 --> 00:18:50.362
- I wanna heal faster, and
this probably be a good idea.

00:18:50.395 --> 00:18:52.831 align:start size:94% position:6%
- All right, so I wanna talk
about a couple of things.

00:18:52.864 --> 00:18:55.467
One, this episode
is really different

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:56.601 align:start size:78% position:22%
from a lot of Mind
Field episodes,

00:18:56.634 --> 00:18:59.872 align:start size:84% position:16%
because we're
treating people in it.

00:19:01.239 --> 00:19:03.675 align:start size:81% position:19%
And we're following
their stories.

00:19:03.708 --> 00:19:07.212
A ungenerous way to look at
this is that in this episode,

00:19:07.245 --> 00:19:08.514
we're lying to children

00:19:09.881 --> 00:19:12.884
and performing fake
medicine on children.

00:19:12.917 --> 00:19:15.253
Dr. Veissière, what
are your thoughts?

00:19:15.286 --> 00:19:18.190 line:0%
- So if you carefully examine
what we say, it is correct

00:19:18.223 --> 00:19:20.659 line:0%
that we never tell a lie,

00:19:20.692 --> 00:19:23.562 line:0%
that we explain the
mechanism correctly.

00:19:23.595 --> 00:19:25.697 align:start size:78% position:22%
However, to be
completely honest,

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:29.201
we do probably rely
on the children's

00:19:30.602 --> 00:19:33.371
to some extent uncritical faith

00:19:33.404 --> 00:19:34.906 align:start size:81% position:19%
in the healing
power of the machine

00:19:34.939 --> 00:19:37.542 align:start size:81% position:19%
on the one hand,
and their own brain.

00:19:37.575 --> 00:19:41.379
And this is because we know it
is very effective for people

00:19:41.412 --> 00:19:42.981 align:start size:81% position:19%
to be able to
relax their worries

00:19:43.014 --> 00:19:44.849 align:start size:91% position:9%
