01:12:39.154 --> 01:12:40.655 line:0%
(bell ringing)

01:12:40.688 --> 01:12:42.891 line:0%
(upbeat music)

01:12:42.924 --> 01:12:45.160 line:0%
A couple was taking their two
children to the playground

01:12:45.193 --> 01:12:47.496 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
when they saw a woman
sunbathing nude.

01:12:47.529 --> 01:12:48.430
