01:12:48.463 --> 01:12:49.631 line:0%
there could be a gender gap.

01:12:49.664 --> 01:12:52.667 line:0%
We're also learning a lot about
the world views people have.

01:12:52.700 --> 01:12:54.536 line:0%
- [Jeff] Yeah, absolutely.

01:12:54.569 --> 01:12:55.437 line:0%
(bell ringing)

01:12:55.470 --> 01:12:58.473 line:0%
