at the Lincoln Memorial

01:13:03.044 --> 01:13:04.579 line:0%
in Washington, DC.

01:13:04.612 --> 01:13:05.981 line:0%
One, 40 hours.

01:13:06.014 --> 01:13:08.049 line:0%
