is more consistent.

02:22:27.972 --> 02:22:29.040
So there's water flowing

02:22:29.073 --> 02:22:30.775 align:start size:88% position:13%
in a bunch of
directions in the brain.

02:22:30.808 --> 02:22:32.877
But let's say you look at a
little chunk of gray matter,

02:22:32.910 --> 02:22:34.745
there's not gonna be a
consistent direction,

02:22:34.778 --> 02:22:36.080
it's gonna be going
in all directions.

02:22:36.113 --> 02:22:38.716 align:start size:88% position:13%
If you average them out,
there's not a single,

02:22:38.749 --> 02:22:40.117
like trajectory for water for.

02:22:40.150 --> 02:22:44.155 align:start size:97% position:3%
- Sure, what does the
