02:22:46.890 --> 02:22:48.693 align:start size:94% position:6%
- Well, your brain has
tons of water in it, right?

02:22:48.726 --> 02:22:50.194
- Yeah.

02:22:50.227 --> 02:22:52.863
- And water is flowing along
these white matter tracks,

02:22:52.896 --> 02:22:54.632 align:start size:81% position:19%
and it's going along
that direction.

02:22:54.665 --> 02:22:56.100
And so if you are tracking

02:22:56.133 --> 02:22:57.301 align:start size:84% position:16%
the direction of water
flow in the brain,

02:22:57.334 --> 02:23:00.605
and you can see a consistent
