02:23:00.638 --> 02:23:01.973
from here to here to here
to here to here to here,

02:23:02.006 --> 02:23:03.274
it tells me there's probably

02:23:03.307 --> 02:23:06.110 align:start size:81% position:19%
a white matter tract
going this way.

02:23:06.143 --> 02:23:09.013 align:start size:94% position:6%
- Right, Okay, so are we
