02:41:45.094 --> 02:41:46.896
the same number
of choice points,

02:41:46.929 --> 02:41:49.899
the same number of turns,
the same total distance

02:41:49.932 --> 02:41:53.269
to each one of the objects to
try to have a similar maze,

02:41:53.302 --> 02:41:54.738
but that's new.

02:41:54.771 --> 02:41:55.905
Three,

02:41:55.938 --> 02:41:56.740
two,

02:41:56.773 --> 02:41:57.373
one,

02:41:57.406 --> 02:41:58.875
go.

